  "synthesis": "Tampa seagrass levels are strongly structured by persistent transect identity for recorded occurrence, within-transect frequency and Braun-Blanquet state, while blade length and shoot density are substantially more temporally labile. A simple annually refreshed neighborhood state at the four frozen EOG radii does not improve mean out-of-time prediction beyond stable node identity plus local lag-1. This favors a local-site-template/local-meadow-state interpretation over simple annual neighborhood-accessibility control.",
